  "title": "Dairy-Free Breakfast Blueberry Cheesecake Muffins",
  "description": "These delicious hybrid blueberry-cheesecake muffins are perfect for breakfast and made dairy-free using soy milk and tofu &#34;cream cheese.&#34;",
  "authors": [
